{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415480","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415480","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1041548001:1":{"text":"오, 귀여운 두 친구. 2인 안무가 정말 화려하고도 우아하네요. 이 즐거운 파티와 잘 어울려요.","source_cn":"噢，两位可爱的小朋友。你们的双人舞真是华丽优雅，与这欢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B39F6B565613C62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041548002:1":{"text":"뭐라고요?","source_cn":"他在说什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62F2AB388EE0F19F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041548003:1":{"text":"귀엽다고요?","source_cn":"可爱？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x069E05816BB57DC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041548004:1":{"text":"처음 듣는 얘기도 아닌데, 뭐.","source_cn":"不是第一次听到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82FC53182E788158","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041548005:1":{"text":"저 사람이라면 이상할 것도 없어.","source_cn":"是他的话也不奇怪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A6928B8859B1A9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041548006:1":{"text":"여러분에겐 더 큰 무대가 필요할 것 같은데 같이 더 화려한 연회를 여는 것은 어때요?","source_cn":"要不要一起举办一个更华丽的宴会，你们需要一个更大的舞台！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC7C365F6BA67022","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041548007:1":{"text":"저흰 괜찮아요.","source_cn":"我们不需要。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD02D73C76D68BB36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041548008:1":{"text":"한 잔 하시죠. 여러분이라면 던릴처럼 흥을 깰 것 같진 않은데.","source_cn":"来喝一杯吧，相信你们不会像顿里尔那样无趣扫兴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x999291CDFB3BE151","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041548009:1":{"text":"일반적인 규칙은 깨도록 하죠. 어차피 여러분도 진짜 아이는 아니잖아요?","source_cn":"打破那些俗常戒律吧，你们也不是真的小孩子，不是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2C88DD107BB59E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041548010:1":{"text":"관심 없어요.","source_cn":"没兴趣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA505BA4BE5F6EC64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041548011:1":{"text":"그런 것보다 박수를 치는 게 더 재미있을 것 같네요.","source_cn":"还是拍手有意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D78E4B80C375F1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041548012:1":{"text":"그건 여러분이 아직 성대한 연회의 즐거움을 누리지 못했기 때문이겠죠.","source_cn":"那是因为你们还没有享受到盛大宴会的乐趣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFE0B26506024D93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041548013:1":{"text":"눈부시게 화려한 무대, 조명, 정교한 식기의 배치와 우아한 음악...","source_cn":"金碧辉煌的舞台、灯光，精致的餐具陈设，优美的音乐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x760649D9603086BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041548014:1":{"text":"일리아, 지금 자기 자신한테 취해있는 것 같아.","source_cn":"伊莱亚，他在自我陶醉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17BF58E9C4AC366F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041548015:1":{"text":"가자, 라이라.","source_cn":"我们走吧，莱拉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9434CCD85F2160D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:萨基塔里斯":{"text":"샤키탈리스","source":"萨基塔里斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伊莱亚":{"text":"일리아","source":"伊莱亚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱拉":{"text":"라이라","source":"莱拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伊莱亚和莱拉":{"text":"일리아&라이라","source":"伊莱亚和莱拉","status":"matched_dial